1434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8796ddab2424e4885331316b49b0ba31", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd1da48c/uploads/origins/2ae4067a-81b0-4622-af26-6a728c2a1434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8796ddab2424e4885331316b49b0ba31, https://si.imgix.net/cd1da48c/uploads/origins/2ae4067a-81b0-4622-af26-6a728c2a1434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90d5a48fe250a73403dfa32a17ab8f4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd1da48c/uploads/origins/2ae4067a-81b0-4622-af26-6a728c2a1434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=24750e5989aeba6eacdc02e729b6313a 3x"}, "body": "I would like a drawing based on the following situation.\n\nSaya and Amnesia sees Elaina meeting with Henrik. Saya and Amnesia are hiding behind a bench. Henrik is traveling to buy some supplies. While holding a map, Henrik asks Elaina for help around the town. Elaina and Henrik talk about the town. Saya and Amnesia are angry after seeing Elaina with Henrik.\n\nElaina and Saya\nhttps://www.animatetimes.com/news/details.php?id=1759411812\n\nAmnesia\nhttps://majotabi.jp/\n\nHenrik\nhttps://www.sbcr.jp/product/4815603779/\nhttps://www.sbcr.jp/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/%E9%80%80%E9%AD%94%E5%B8%AB_s.jpg\n\nこの状況に合わせて描いてください。\n\n「魔女の旅々」より、サヤとアムネジアはイレイナとヘンリクが会うのを見ます。サヤとアムネジアはベンチで隠れます。ヘンリクは旅行中で、町で必需品を買うからです。ヘンリクは地図を持って、イレイナに助けを求めます。イレイナとヘンリクは町について話します。イレイナとヘンリクは会ったので、サヤとアムネジアは怒りました。\n\nイレイナとサヤ\nhttps://www.animatetimes.com/news/details.php?id=1759411812\n\nアムネジア\nhttps://majotabi.jp/\n\nヘンリク\nhttps://www.sbcr.jp/product/4815603779/\nhttps://www.sbcr.jp/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/%E9%80%80%E9%AD%94%E5%B8%AB_s.jpg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UMYU13137/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creat